# RDPID—Read Processor ID -- override
# 'DEST := IA32_TSC_AUX' (zero-extended). Opcodes: the page's table has no
# Instruction column.
@opcodes
F3 0F C7 /7 | RDPID r32 | R | N.E. | Valid
F3 0F C7 /7 | RDPID r64 | R | Valid | N.E.
@encoding
R | ModRM:r/m (w) | N/A | N/A | N/A
@operation
DEST := TSC_AUX;
